{"id":"vod_bf_29964","vodId":"29964","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"神的记事本","name_cn":"神的记事本","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-31/6728e991f793280b5a71580a1325b87e.jpg"},"summary":"在闹市区的后巷中，平凡高中生藤岛鸣海（松冈祯丞 配音）目睹了一桩突发事件。不日，他被同班同学彩夏带去了她打工的“花丸拉面店”，在这里，他居然又遇到了当天那三个“可疑人物”——柏青哥高手阿哲、“军事宅男”少校以及相貌俊美的宏哥，三人自称为“尼特族侦探”。就在鸣海一头雾水时，他阴错阳差地来到了“NEET侦探事务所”，遇上了一名奇怪的少女爱丽丝（小仓唯 配音）。爱丽丝看似是一个足不出户的家里蹲，事实上她是个拥有高超技术的网络黑客，她利用自己的能力接受委托，成为尼特族侦探。　　因缘际遇下，鸣海当上了爱丽丝的助手，帮助调查事件。这个没什么存在感的平凡高中生，在尼特族侦探团中能起到作用吗？曾经不希望和别人有过多来往的鸣海，会和爱丽丝以及尼特族的大家产生什么样的羁绊？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 06:53:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shendejishiben/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:49.851Z"}